  "abstract": "Covers the OpenAPI Specification 3.2 (pinned at 3.2.1) with compatibility for 3.1: document structure, paths, operations, parameters, streaming media types, tags, security schemes and requirements, the 3.1 to 3.2 upgrade and the registered x-oai fallbacks, the OAI Extension and Namespace registries, and validation against the official OAS JSON Schemas. It tracks the 3.3 development line and the Security Profiles proposal without building on them. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, objects, security, registries, validation and drafts.",
